Some  Fujitsu laptops come with vendor‐specific devices to manage
the laptop hotkeys (such as the button), and to  control  various
built‐in  components  (such as the display, the touchpad, and the
speakers).  The and drivers provide support,  through  these  de‐
vices,  for  hotkeys,  backlight  on/off switch, brightness level
control, and pointer on/off  switch.   The  following  read/write
variables  are  provided  (when  hardware  support is available):
Brightness level  (integer).   Pointer  switch  state  (boolean).
Backlight switch state (boolean).  Please note, however, that fu‐
ture  versions  of the drivers may remove these variables without
prior notice.  The and drivers appeared in Brightness  level  and
